    "notes": [
      "Palette capped at 8; dropped: #ffffff33 (white 20% overlay on teaser image placeholders, 501) — alpha overlay, not a brand color; #111111 (118, teaser text/link) — clusters with #000000 visually (ΔE≈5.6, kept out to respect the 8-cap); #ffc000 (48, legal-table cell backgrounds on data-protection pages only); #8080801a / #9696964d (lazyload placeholder gradient + scroll-hint tints); #969696 (26, tertiary-button hover + sticky-header shadow); #fe9a2e (4, brand-page table cells), #daebe6 (2, .o-container.is-pastel-green, 1 page), #e38702 kept as accent-1; Defined but not observed in the census: #ffe0e1 (.is-pastel-red), #e5edf7 (.is-pastel-blue)",
      "Census role for #6b6b6b was \"accent\"; renamed \"secondary\" (nav link color, primary-button hover fill, tertiary button background).",
      "site.css :root ships Bootstrap default --primary:#007bff, never applied — brand primary is #ffa500 (CSS keyword `orange`). pages/*.json#customProps is empty on every page (capture reads no document-level custom props), but site.css defines component-scoped tokens (--quote-*, --jobcard-*, --header-height-*, --breakpoint-*).",
      "Radius: cross-page mode 28px (primary) is mostly icon circles (1.6rem .u-icon.has-bg, quicksearch submit); area mode 24px (secondary, 1.3714rem) is the CTA pill on 48px-tall buttons — componentStyle.buttons uses 24px. Home-only mode not separately computed.",
      "Home h1 \"Welcome to Continental\" sits below the c-heroteaser-fixed slider stage; the stage leads with rotating news slides (Results Q2 2026). Vision-check marks en/de \"suspect\": consent modal covered hero in screenshots.",
      "Logo: census aggregate.logo.source=none (logo is an inline svg inside span.t3js-icon, not <img>); taken from header a.o-header__logo → assets/logo.svg.",
      "Hero medium: home video (video.js, blob: src) is a mid-page \"Continental Tires Garage\" feature, not the stage → heroMedium null.",
      "Capture gaps: 25 census failures (see _computed-styles.json#_provenance.failed); 1 crawl 404 (/en/investors/api-events/); uncaptured first-level targets on country roots (_crawl-log.json#captureGaps)."
    ]
